STORY-008 Community Features is complete. Here's what was implemented:

**New features added:**
1. **Post types** (general, review, tip, recipe, question) - visible as colored badges on each post card, selectable when creating posts
2. **User profiles** (`app/user-profile.tsx`) - shows avatar, bio, crunchy score with tier badge, total scans, follower/following counts, and user's post history
3. **Follow/unfollow** - button on user profile screen with visual state toggle
4. **Content moderation** - report button on posts (ellipsis menu), report button on comments (flag icon), report user option on profile
5. **Tap-to-profile** - tapping username/avatar on posts or comments navigates to that user's profile

