- `data/community.ts` - Added `PostType`, `CommunityUser`, `POST_TYPE_CONFIG`, 10 user profiles, `postType` on all posts
- `app/(tabs)/community.tsx` - Post type badges, report post/comment, user profile navigation
- `app/create-post.tsx` - Post type selector with context-aware placeholder text
- `app/user-profile.tsx` (new) - Full user profile screen
- `prd.json` - Marked STORY-008 as passes: true

